{"server":"tw","storyId":"act5d0_level_act5d0_08_end","groupId":"act5d0","stageId":"act5d0_08","title":"11:41P.M.","storyCode":"CB-8","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"8c6eb015fdd589620c7fbc31ef424d47b448b740bfc3d9f4b4d5189f64c9313e","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"伊斯遭到了某位黎博利的監視，而莫斯提馬也早已知曉鼠王存在。重新會合的企鵝物流眾人得到了大帝的聯絡，前往派對現場。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"11:45 P.M.    天氣/多雲\n龍門市區，露天咖啡吧"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"——不錯的香味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"露天咖啡吧，三明治，燭光，人流，糖果的香氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"如果沒有這位小姐把我盯得死死的。我也許會更輕鬆一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"......我只是偶然路過，但是你手上拿著的東西似乎不太可以用偶然解釋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"我解釋過。莫斯提馬正作為企鵝物流的一員完成著她的委託。而我也只是幫她代為保管這把法杖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得我會放走一個對著她的法杖自言自語的怪胎嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"怪、怪胎......這就請當做沒有看見吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"她不會有事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有在擔心她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"她也不會惹事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"......但願吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"......（也許我應該乖乖待在酒店裡。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"喲，你在這裡，剛才那是怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"......突然心血來潮罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"你的心血來潮是不是太用力了點？明明企鵝物流也在場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"而且你也一把年紀了，總是這麼拼命，不會短命嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得我出了幾分力？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"......是嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"那至少稍微收斂一些你的殺氣如何？我都快不敢當著你的面說話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"發生了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，也許我小看了年輕人的警戒心，龍門的年輕人總是會讓我吃驚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼大事，不過是有幾個失控的傀儡，誤傷了一位盡心盡責的魚丸師傅，僅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"“僅此而已”？你應該學會管理一下表情，再來說這種話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"......一直保持的微笑就失去了微笑的意義。比起你，我倒還輕鬆一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"這難道不在你的預料之內嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"比如，為了防止企鵝物流和黑手黨的衝突不好收尾，先找一個可以親自懲戒他們的藉口，之類的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"——你這丫頭，陪著那隻企鵝胡鬧，真的是暴殄天物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"哪裡哪裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"......但我也沒有允許他們隨意踐踏貧民窟。我從未允許。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經儘量容忍了他們的僭越，但他們還是壞了規矩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"本以為他們和敘拉古那點若有若無的聯繫可以為龍門帶來那麼一丁點有趣的利益......真是讓人失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"停一停......幹嘛和我說這麼多？下一步是要把我滅口了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"老人也是需要發發牢騷的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎，那我就當只是一場安魂節狂歡吧。剛才你說的那些東西我全部都沒聽見喔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"那些黑手黨鬧的越大，說不定事後的尾款我就能拿到更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"那有了錢之後呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"先把那家糖果鋪買下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，你還真是情有獨鍾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊，除了地下室，其他東西隨你搬走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"果然是有地下室的嗎......你就不能稍微保護一下我的美好回憶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"那可是我的鋪子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"真是太可惜了，我本以為你退休之後真的會去當一個雜貨鋪老闆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"也許吧，如果退休的時候我還活著的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"時候不早了，接下來狂歡才算正式開始。戲子伶人都已經各就各位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"不打算繼續袖手旁觀了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"......這裡風景不錯吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"安魂夜是恭送亡者的節日，而龍門終歸是我們的城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"活著的人們熱熱鬧鬧的，亡魂才能沒有遺憾地離去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"而且一個半隻腳踏進棺材裡的老鼠，要是不活動活動筋骨，說不定會被某些別有用心的傢伙誤當成已死的亡靈喔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"那該怎麼熱鬧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"就該如此熱鬧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"——啊，原來如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"那這場安魂的花銷似乎有點大，嗯，甚至有點浪費。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"你很聰明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"也是，否則魏長官早就來找你的麻煩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"別說那麼嚇人的事，我可不想再和近衛局打交道了，太麻煩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"而這一齣好戲的精髓就在於，所有的開銷，都由演員自己承擔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"哈啊，哈啊，那、那些傢伙也是黑手黨的成員嗎？我們還要跑多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"明顯不是，說不定只是之前和我們結下樑子的地痞流氓。數量太多，不想記嘛，跑就是了，總能甩掉的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"可我剛才看見有個傢伙是拿著擀麵棍衝出來的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"打架一般都是這樣的啦，你很少來貧民窟？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"因為太不注意，偶爾會把牙齒和血擀進麵裡，然後遭到客戶猛烈的差評，咬到別人牙齒的時候——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"不需要這麼聲色並茂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......莫斯提馬小姐和能天使是舊識？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"你逐漸開始直呼其名了哎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"莫斯提馬小姐說，她是我的考官......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"啥？我怎麼從來沒聽說過？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......我想也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼只有莫斯提馬會加上尊稱，這區別對待也太明顯了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"我理想中的信使——我堅持這份職業的理由，目的，她似乎都做到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......有點羡慕吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然完全不知道她在想什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"那太正常了，我追著她從拉特蘭來到龍門，然後遇到了老闆，直到今天，還是不太明白她在想什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"最近我已經放棄了。乾脆等她自己不曉得什麼時候出現在身後比較安逸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"不要說得這麼可怕......慢著，從拉特蘭追到龍門？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼，你很在意嗎~？別看我這樣，其實我也完全不輸給莫斯提馬，也許稍微差那麼一點點——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"不，說真的並不是很在意。我們應該快點和德克薩斯小姐會合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"用力過度了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"這算是正當防衛，沒問題的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！德克薩斯~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"你們沒事，但是莫斯提馬呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"這個問題有什麼必要嗎，看不就知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"好像也是，抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"......為什麼要抱歉，還有你們看著我幹嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈......莫斯提馬既然回來了，遲早能見到面的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"比起這個，我們應該先集中對付新的敵人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼這到底是怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"莫非是對之前我們大聲擾民的報復？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"有可能喔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"有可能嗎！？貧民窟是這麼暴躁的地方嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"不打不相識嘛，拳拳到肉可是最古老有效的交流手段。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"有聯絡，是老闆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂~？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"玩的還開心嗎？有沒有缺胳膊少腿之類的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒有？那好，聽我說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......大帝先生，是不是買了很多保險？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"今晚在軲轆街有個安魂節狂歡盛典。盡是一些沒牌面的行銷活動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我突然決定參加那場活動，作為一名偉大的音樂人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為龍門帶來一些有格調的噪音。他們感激涕零，已經在樓下跪得整整齊齊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"至於你們的任務，就只是跟在我的身後，然後把那些號稱要解決企鵝物流的蠢貨一網打盡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"明白了嗎？明白了？好！就這樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......掛了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎麼感覺這事似曾相識？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"......總之，我們也要去那個什麼派對就對了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，出發！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_101_sora","aliases":["空"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["德克薩斯"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["能天使"]},{"speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","aliases":["可頌"]},{"speakerId":"char_213_mostma","aliases":["莫斯提馬"]},{"speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","aliases":["？？？"]},{"speakerId":"char_325_bison","aliases":["拜松"]}]}
